/* Gap round mcp-gap-r2 (9-Nov-2026), searches that returned 0 or thin results: "empty state first run checklist",
   "dashboard with kpi stat tiles and onboarding checklist", "media library image picker gallery modal", "delete confirmation dialog
   with image preview", "compact logo badge dark header", "loyalty stamp card wallet pass on phone".
   Patterns: first-run (checklist | blank-slate), media-library (picker | delete-preview) for Fernway (workspace),
   compact-header (site | app) for Patchbay (marketing section), loyalty-card (stamp-card | wallet-pass) for Kiln & Crumb (cafeapp).
   Not duplicates of empty-state (pilot.js, inbox zero), delete-confirm (gap-misc.js, typed / file list), confirm-dialog (overlays.js)
   or navigation-header (sections-b.js, mega menu). People and companies are invented (recurring cast from AUTHORING.md). */
